  answer:"It is the recognition of a financial asset. Debit the loan, credit cash.<br><strong>In PCS.</strong> DR 141000 Investments at Cost, CR 111000 Cash, dated on the drawdown date. Drawdowns are never aggregated into accrual periods \u2014 they are dated events where money actually moved.",
  demoSteps:[],
  deal:null,
