  answer:"The undrawn balance. It is the price of holding capital available. As the facility draws, interest rises and the commitment fee falls.<br><strong>In PCS.</strong> Balance basis is a stated field per fee \u2014 principal balance, unfunded balance, principal plus capitalised, or unfunded net of capitalisations. PCS derives the balance from the movements rather than taking it on trust.",
  demoSteps:[],
