  tags:["benchmark", "curve", "estr", "fixing", "floating", "forecast", "lockout", "lookback", "observation", "rates", "rfr", "sofr", "sonia", "supported"],
  answer:"Compounded-in-arrears risk-free rates \u2014 SONIA, SOFR, ESTR, TONA, SARON \u2014 and forward-looking term rates including Term SOFR, EURIBOR, BBSW and BBSY, plus fixed.",
