  answer:"You need a forward view. Without one, the rate is held flat at the last actual \u2014 which is shown as <em>held-flat</em> on the schedule, labelled as an assumption rather than presented as an observation.<br><strong>In PCS.</strong> Rate provenance is tracked per day: actual, forecast, held-flat or base.",
  demoSteps:[],
