  answer:"No. A modified asset that was in Stage 2 does not return to Stage 1 merely because it was amended. The standard specifically warns against this \u2014 the risk comparison remains against initial recognition of the original asset.<br><em>Standard: IFRS 9 \u00a7B5.5.25 \u2013 \u00a7B5.5.27.</em>",
