  answer:"Better to say \"let me check and come back with a precise answer\" than to improvise. Private credit has a long tail \u2014 tranching with different seniorities, cross-currency structures, NAV facilities, rated note feeders \u2014 and the honest limits are easier to defend than an optimistic yes.",
